{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3251","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3251","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3251\",\"parent_revision\":\"1aa37643406a0a7bd6fa06498305a96e05eb18b8f19542942fd744cefcd805e1\",\"root_revision\":\"1aa37643406a0a7bd6fa06498305a96e05eb18b8f19542942fd744cefcd805e1\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-27\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n.claude/skills/swarm-operations/SKILL.md (labeled \\\"API reference for multi-agent orchestration tools in Claude Code v2.1.45\\\") documents SendMessage's direct-message form at lines 47-58 as requiring fields `type`, `recipient`, `content`, `summary`:\\n\\n```javascript\\nSendMessage({\\n  type: \\\"message\\\",\\n  recipient: \\\"security-reviewer\\\",\\n  content: \\\"...\\\",\\n  summary: \\\"...\\\"\\n})\\n```\\n\\nThe live SendMessage tool's actual current schema requires `to` and `message` (optional `summary`, `notify_when_idle`) \u2014 there is no `type`, `recipient`, or `content` field in the tool's JSON schema at all.\\n\\nVerified empirically in the session that surfaced this: `SendMessage(to=\\\"gr3244-impact\\\", message=\\\"...\\\")` was called directly and delivered successfully (\\\"Message sent to gr3244-impact's inbox\\\"), and multiple sibling agents in the same swarm reached the orchestrator using this identical `to`/`message` form. The doc's documented shape would be rejected by the live tool.\\n\\nThis is exactly the failure mode a stale API-reference skill causes: an agent or human reading swarm-operations/SKILL.md and following its example verbatim would produce a call the actual tool rejects.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Surfaced by a Codex review comment on PR #3249, citing .claude/skills/swarm-operations/SKILL.md:47-58 for the SendMessage contract; verified against the live tool schema and this session's own successful SendMessage calls\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-27\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"8f905cd12742b5324ebfe74c32d15b0aecd08489829a9c6e882962a0338995b6\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRBawvw\"}"}